  "description": "<p><strong>Canon EOS 800D18-135mm lens</strong></p>\r\n<p><em>Inclusief:</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Oplader </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Specificaties:</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>18-135MM Lens </li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec\"> 24,2Mpx </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Sensortype </span><span class=\"spec\">CMOS</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Sensorformaat </span><span class=\"spec\"> APS-C (cropfactor 1.6) </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Beelden per seconde 6Fps </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Minimale ISO 100 </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Maximale ISO </span><span class=\"spec\">25600 </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Langste sluitertijd </span><span class=\"spec\">30s</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Kortste sluitertijd </span><span class=\"spec\"> 1/4000 sec. </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Aantal autofocuspunten 45  </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Focusmechanisme </span> <span class=\"spec\">Automatische </span><span class=\"spec\">Focus (motor in lens), Handmatige Focus </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec\">3 Inch beeldscherm </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec\"> </span><span class=\"spec-label\">Touchscreentechniek </span><span class=\"spec\"> Capacitief </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Zoeker </span><span class=\"spec\"> Optisch (OVF) </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Zoeker vergroting </span><span class=\"spec\"> 0,82x </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Geheugenkaart (camera)</span><span class=\"spec\"> SD, SDHC, SDXC </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Aantal opslagkaarten 1x</span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Verbinding (extern) </span><span class=\"spec\"> HDMI mini, USB 2.0 mini </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Microfoonaansluiting </span><span class=\"spec\"> Jackplug 3.5mm </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Gps </span><span class=\"spec\"> Optioneel </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Verbinding (wlan)</span><span class=\"spec\"> 802.11b, 802.11g, Wi-Fi 4 (802.11n) </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec\"> Bluetooth 4.1 </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Overige draadloze verbindingen </span><span class=\"spec\"> Near Field Communication (NFC) </span></li>\r\n<li><span class=\"spec-label\">Eigenschappen body </span><span class=\"spec\"> 5-axis stabilisatie, Ingebouwde flitser, Kantelbaar scherm, Live view </span></li>\r\n<li>Werkt uitstekend</li>\r\n<li>Verkeert in goede staat<br><br>Garantie:<br>3 MAANDEN GARANTIE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Bij ons: €449,99<strong><br></strong></strong></p>",
